      "text": "# Analysis Worksheet\n\nFill one block per source image during Phase 2. Copy the block for each image. This worksheet is the raw material for the suite JSON — do not skip fields.\n\n```\n## Image <n>  (file: <name>)\n- Funnel role / shotRole:        (HERO | PAIN_POINT | COMPARISON | SCENE | DETAIL | TRUST | VARIANT | CTA)\n- What it does (1 line):\n- Composition / 构图:\n- Camera / 机位:\n- Shot size / 景别:\n- Light direction & quality / 光位:\n- Shadow type:\n- Background & surface (material + hex):\n- Props & placement:\n- Product occupancy:\n- Whitespace (compositional margin, usually none):\n- Text zone (for suites with in-image copy) + text meaning (not the words):\n- Color system (dominant + accent hex):\n- Mood / aesthetic:\n- SOURCE-SPECIFIC ELEMENTS TO STRIP:   (brand, logo, model face, exact copy, unique typography, proprietary layout, etc.)\n```\n\n---\n\n## Set-level summary (after all images)\n\n```\n- Main product (1 line):\n- Category: L1 = ____  L2 = ____  leaf = ____ (free text)\n- leafKeywords (3-8):\n- productFamily (fashion|electronics|beauty|food|home|jewelry):\n- Conversion driver (视觉 | 痛点 | 情感):\n- Selling points visible in images (no invention):\n- Pain points visible in images:\n- Duplicate roles merged:\n- Images dropped (pure decoration / near-duplicate) and why:\n\n## Campaign Style Lock (draft)\n- direction:\n- palette (base 2-3 + accent, hex):\n- temperature:\n- backgroundSystem:\n- lightingSystem:\n- surfaceSystem:\n- typography:\n- iconSystem:\n- presentationRules:\n- noDrift:\n- lockText (assembled English):\n```\n"
